summary.label:
*Altitude Compass* gives you:
1. Altitude, latitude and longitude data reading from GPS;
2. Capturing photo and adding environment information on photo(iPhone only currently);
3. Choose your compass theme such as Classic, Waves, Rings and Maps;
4. Seamless switching between light mode and dark mode, and picking your font;
5. Reading altitude from device altimeter (require iPhone 12 or later device and iOS 15 or later system);
6. Realtime barometric pressure.
